module Core

### Suflae SF-realm Core set — roam-boundary wrapper over a bare RF::Core.Set[T].
### Only the entity + default constructor are hand-written; every other method is auto-forwarded to
### `inner` by SynthesizeSuflaeForwarders, which also re-wraps any method that returns a wrapped
### entity (`copy` → Set, element-list returns → List).
entity Set[T]
  secret inner: RF::Core.Set[T]

routine Set[T]() -> Set[T]
  return Set[T](inner: RF::Core.Set[T]())
